    - target: {fileID: 2298647161643049540, guid: 0222a1b4f9c504f4cb194ba535c119ea, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\n\nSubstitute into the circular permutation formula
        for a key ring with a lock\n\nKey Ring Permutation(6) = \\frac{6!}{2}\n\t\u200B\nSimplify
        the expression\n\nKey Ring Permutation(6) =  \\frac{720}{2}\n\nDivide\n\n\\frac{720}{2}
        = 360\n\nKey Ring Permutation(6) = 360\n\nThere are 360 distinct arrangements
        of 6 different keys on a key ring with a lock."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
